    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Mechanically rich and satisfying movement, loosely inspired by Surf and B-Hop<br></li><li> 5 gamemodes<br></li><li> Multiplayer<br></li><li> A large, playground-like world</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560050/extras/646f5310361a7b7a5d9ce80d1b932ae5.avif?t=1753949137\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Rail Grinding</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Sliding</strong>, <strong>Wall Running</strong> and <strong>Climbing</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Air Strafing</strong> and <strong>Bunny Hopping</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560050/extras/43e63715a77c37723e342dca348434ed.avif?t=1753949137\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Timed</strong> - 15+ time trials<br></li><li> <strong>Orders</strong> - Complete orders and go for the highscore<br></li><li> <strong>Zen</strong> - Relax and practice<br></li><li> ...and 2 multiplayer gamemodes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560050/extras/7daf2f609be05729940f42c4e4d2040a.avif?t=1753949137\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Capture</strong> - A capture the flag-esque gamemode<br></li><li> <strong>Infection</strong> - Infect, or avoid becoming infected<br></li><li> <strong>Timed</strong> and <strong>Zen</strong> are also supported<br></li><li> Proximity chat<br></li><li> Public server browser</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560050/extras/7a6a4e3f5b98146bc387d0cc9796c40f.avif?t=1753949137\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create levels for Timed, Capture, Infection, and Zen<br></li><li> Play by yourself, or online</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Mechanically rich and satisfying movement, loosely inspired by Surf and B-Hop<br></li><li> 5 gamemodes<br></li><li> Multiplayer<br></li><li> A large, playground-like world</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560050/extras/646f5310361a7b7a5d9ce80d1b932ae5.avif?t=1753949137\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Rail Grinding</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Sliding</strong>, <strong>Wall Running</strong> and <strong>Climbing</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Air Strafing</strong> and <strong>Bunny Hopping</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560050/extras/43e63715a77c37723e342dca348434ed.avif?t=1753949137\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Timed</strong> - 15+ time trials<br></li><li> <strong>Orders</strong> - Complete orders and go for the highscore<br></li><li> <strong>Zen</strong> - Relax and practice<br></li><li> ...and 2 multiplayer gamemodes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560050/extras/7daf2f609be05729940f42c4e4d2040a.avif?t=1753949137\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Capture</strong> - A capture the flag-esque gamemode<br></li><li> <strong>Infection</strong> - Infect, or avoid becoming infected<br></li><li> <strong>Timed</strong> and <strong>Zen</strong> are also supported<br></li><li> Proximity chat<br></li><li> Public server browser</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560050/extras/7a6a4e3f5b98146bc387d0cc9796c40f.avif?t=1753949137\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create levels for Timed, Capture, Infection, and Zen<br></li><li> Play by yourself, or online</li></ul>",
